3. Qualified Small Business

A "Qualified Small Business" is an organization that, together with every
entity controlling, controlled by, or under common control with it, satisfies
all of the following at the time of use:

  a. registered capital is less than CNY 3,000,000, or the closest legally
     comparable measure where registered capital does not apply;
  b. gross revenue for the preceding fiscal year is less than CNY 10,000,000;
     and
  c. it has fewer than 30 employees and individual contractors in aggregate.

If any threshold is met or exceeded, the organization is not a Qualified Small
Business and must obtain a commercial license before continuing production
use. The Licensor may request reasonable information to verify eligibility.

